      "GEORGIA: I used to buy all my clothes at the store where I work. Cause of my discount. But all that crap's made by poor slave girls in Indonesian swe…\nSALESGIRL: So's this stuff.\nGEORGIA: Maybe ... but this is a fine example of slave girl work!\nGEORGIA: Answer me straight. You think anyone would ever call me \"ma'am\" in this dress?",
